WEBVTT

00:18:25.901 --> 00:18:31.043
that whatever is going to just happen
in a long-term relationship, already has.

00:18:31.067 --> 00:18:33.829
Committed sex is premeditated sex.

00:18:33.853 --> 00:18:36.145
It's willful. It's intentional.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.217
It's focus and presence.

00:18:40.114 --> 00:18:41.234
Merry Valentine's.

00:18:41.258 --> 00:18:44.404
(Applause)